#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/7bd8c6d4-f40f-4a11-a440-0b26d9021b53-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Saída da célula de código anterior](/learning/images/courses/utility-"
